Local flights are not allowed: daily from 1130 – 1300 (1030 – 1200) and after 1900 (1800), Sun + HOL before 0900 (0800); Cross-country flights taking off into direction 26 are prohibited from 1130 – 1300 (1030 – 1200) on Sun + HOL.

